Description: Support the noudeb build profile
 Lets DEB_BUILD_PROFILES=noudeb leave out libxext6-udeb, the copy of the
 library for Debian-Installer. Carried unchanged from the patch attached to
 Debian bug 1024924 (its debian/control hunk; the changelog hunk is not
 carried, the edition's own entry says it).
Author: Helmut Grohne
Origin: other, https://bugs.debian.org/1024924
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1024924
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
---
--- libxext-1.3.4/debian/control
+++ libxext-1.3.4/debian/control
@@ -60,6 +60,7 @@
 
 Package: libxext6-udeb
 Package-Type: udeb
+Build-Profiles: <!noudeb>
 Section: debian-installer
 Architecture: any
 Depends:
